solvable:summary: GNU Zip Compression Utilities
solvable:description: Gzip reduces the size of the named files using Lempel-Ziv coding LZ77.
Whenever possible, each file is replaced by one with the extension .gz,
while keeping the same ownership modes and access and modification
times.
