solvable:summary: A Real-Time Data Compression Library
solvable:description: LZO is a portable lossless data compression library written in ANSI C.
Decompression requires no memory. LZO is suitable for data compression
and decompression in real-time. This means it favors speed over
compression ratio.
solvable:group: System/Libraries
