rpm:dbid: 251
solvable:summary: Xen Virtualization: Libraries
solvable:description: Xen is a virtual machine monitor for x86 that supports execution of
multiple guest operating systems with unprecedented levels of
performance and resource isolation.

This package contains the libraries used to interact with the Xen
virtual machine monitor.

In addition to this package you need to install xen and xen-tools
to use Xen.
